，简洁","explanation":"간단하다：简单，简短，简洁；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"간단하다","audio":"/audio/f6dc36bb270a1ad55beb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70702","senseId":"1","lemma":"간단하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"간단한","audio":"/audio/74025fd28836f76ca206.mp3"}},{"text":"율동도","meaning":"韵律体操","explanation":"율동：韵律体操；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"율동","audio":"/audio/cfbde3ae8e36abf61ab8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70925","senseId":"2","lemma":"율동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"율동도","audio":"/audio/6125ace74d40ce507130.mp3"}},{"text":"했어요.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했어요","audio":"/audio/767a8404e5a0794daaf5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"4fb922c7724e9669","term":"동요","zh":"童谣，儿歌","audio":"/audio/4fb922c7724e9669ec67.mp3","entryId":"48605","definition":"迎合儿童的喜好而制作的供儿童唱的歌。","pronunciation":["동ː요"]},{"id":"2c65351237177855","term":"배우다","zh":"学，学习","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3","entryId":"62088","definition":"获得新知识。","pronunciation":["배우다"]},{"id":"8c91c4ef7e321cf6","term":"거기","zh":"那儿，那里","audio":"/audio/8c91c4ef7e321cf67426.mp3","entryId":"62258","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的地方。","pronunciation":["거기"]},{"id":"007d45bc6c182fe5","term":"맞추다","zh":"合着，配合，按照","audio":"/audio/007d45bc6c182fe5443f.mp3","entryId":"74127","definition":"符合某个标准或程度。","pronunciation":["맏추다"]},{"id":"f6dc36bb270a1ad5","term":"간단하다","zh":"简单，简短，简洁","audio":"/audio/f6dc36bb270a1ad55beb.mp3","entryId":"70702","definition":"不长或不复杂。","pronunciation":["간단하다"]},{"id":"cfbde3ae8e36abf6","term":"율동",